<h1>Release notes</h1>
<p>Version <em>0.3</em> adds <strong>faster</strong> builds &amp; a <code>--watch</code> flag.</p>
<h2>Changes</h2>
<ul>
  <li>parser: handles <code>a &lt; b</code> in guards</li>
  <li>checker: <strong>no</strong> more <em>spurious</em> warnings</li>
  <li>runtime: 2x faster maps</li>
</ul>
<h2>Upgrade steps</h2>
<ol>
  <li>back up <code>config.toml</code></li>
  <li>run the <em>migrate</em> tool</li>
  <li>restart</li>
</ol>
<blockquote>Note: the old flag still works, but prints a warning.</blockquote>
<pre><code>
dewy build --watch app.dewy
if x &lt; 3 { y }
</code></pre>
<h3>Thanks</h3>
<p>Thanks to everyone who <em>tested</em> the betas.</p>
